Keywords: binutils, ld, a.out

This is the binary release of binutils 2.5.2.1. It has binaries in
a.out.

The primary ftp sites for the compiler/C library are tsx-11.mit.edu
under pub/linux/packages/GCC and sunsite.unc.edu under pub/Linux/GCC.

You need libc 4.6.20 or above to run this package. ld.so 1.5.1 or
above is REQUIRED.

To install this package, please follow the procedure very closely.
Please backup/save all the files you are instructed to delete and you
should do

	tar tvvfz binutils-2.5.2.1.bin.tar.gz

to see what is in there. You may notice that the size of binutils
binaries are huge. That is due to the BFD. That will be resolved once
when we move to ELF which will use a shared BFD library.

The pacth from 2.5.2 to 2.5.2.1, binutils-2.5.2-2.5.2.1.diff, is
in the same ftp directory.

To install, PLEASE DO

1. su root
3. cd /usr/bin
4. rm -f as ar gprof ranlib size objdump objcopy nm strip strings gasp c++filt
5. cd /
6. tar xfz binutils-2.5.2.1.bin.tar.gz

Now you have the new gas/binutils under /usr/bin. 


Thanks.


H.J. Lu
hjl@nynexst.com
11/12/94

