Also included are many of the programs in the Programmer's guide.



                           INSTALLATION GUIDE

Covering installation on the target Operating System, customisation and
compiling, this guide provides easy to follow examples to get SWiM
installed and operational.

We strongly recommend the following books :

        Motif Programming Manual, Vol. 6A,  (O'Reilly Associates)
        Motif Reference Manual, Vol. 6B     (O'Reilly Associates)
        Vol 3M User Guide (Motif Edition)   (O'Reilly Associates)
        Mastering Motif Widgets (Addison Wesley)

to accompany SWiM. Other recommended reading is included in the SWiM
Manual.

                                SUPPORT

As with all our products, free Technical Support is included. If you
have any questions about SWiM, please do not hesitate to contact us.


                  APPLICATIONS and ROYALTY REGULATIONS

You are permitted to distribute your applications created with SWiM as
