Benjamin/Cummings Publishing Company, publishers of several introductory
level Unix books by Mark Sobell (now in their third edition) is seeking
author candidates to work with Mark to adapt one of these proven books to
meet the special needs of newcomers to the Linux OS.  An empathy with the
difficulties a newcomer faces is a must, teaching experience is helpful.
Interested candidates should send a short note outlining their experience
and background to:

